{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482070/extras/773dd63fe78c0fad8b91f6fb70118d76.avif?t=1756749711\" width=600 height=150 /></span><strong><i>Excavator Ball</i></strong> is a <strong>3D</strong> video game where you must overcome various puzzles and challenges with an excavator in a city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome all obstacles in the shortest time possible to unlock several rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, something mysterious happens in the city: the tower lights go out without warning! This tower is the heart of the city, and its lights symbolize balance and peace. When the boss learns about the blackout, he gets furious and decides there will be no rest until the lights are restored. With his anger unleashed, the player is forced to take control of the excavator and face a series of puzzles and challenges blocking the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Face a variety of puzzles and challenges as you explore the city, using your excavator to overcome each obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Control a powerful excavator and use its tools to solve puzzles creatively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Complete challenges in the shortest time possible to unlock rewards and improve your skills.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482070?t=1756749711","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482070/32409b67006fc9e63dca7b33f4299ea326232a3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756749711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482070/b8d6ddeade26bfad01aaae6bd9c807ff413d1b4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756749711","capsule_ima